      "text": "#SAAPM: \"Semper Paratus\" means Always Ready. Sexual assault shatters trust and degrades mission readiness. @USCG remains committed to prevention, trauma-informed care & supporting victims through our Sexual Assault Prevention, Response and Recovery (SAPRR) program.\n\nThis April, as we observe Sexual Assault Awareness and Prevention Month, we reaffirm our resolve to combat sexual assault and sexual harassment. Through the disciplined execution of our SAPRR Strategic Plan, the Coast Guard is honoring our duty to one another, living our Core Values, and preserving the readiness required to protect the American public.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/RLEIxQnx6j",
      "text_resolved": "#SAAPM: \"Semper Paratus\" means Always Ready. Sexual assault shatters trust and degrades mission readiness. @USCG remains committed to prevention, trauma-informed care & supporting victims through our Sexual Assault Prevention, Response and Recovery (SAPRR) program.\n\nThis April, as we observe Sexual Assault Awareness and Prevention Month, we reaffirm our resolve to combat sexual assault and sexual harassment. Through the disciplined execution of our SAPRR Strategic Plan, the Coast Guard is honoring our duty to one another, living our Core Values, and preserving the readiness required to protect the American public.\n\nRead more here: https://www.uscg.mil/addressing-sexual-assault-and-sexual-harassment/",
