      "text": "Steadfast vigilance across 31,000 miles of maritime borders.\n\nThis past week, @USCGSouthwest, @USCGSoutheast & @CBP have stopped 4 vessels off California and Puerto Rico, apprehending 79 aliens. Through layered security and seamless interagency coordination, we continue to defend America’s sovereignty and secure our borders and maritime approaches.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation.\n\n@DHSgov #semperparatus",
